      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOME MAGIC (1) was responsible for a far better performance at his latest appearance when he scored over 2100m at Geelong, getting home by 5 metres after leading. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Tackles a similar assignment and he can make it two on the trot. ISTHISTHEREALLIFE (6) saluted for the second consecutive start last time out when she led and battled on well to score by 1.5 metres at Horsham over 2200m. Meets a similar line up and she is all set to make it a hat-trick. KATUNGA EXPRESS (5) is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance over 1710m at Ballarat. MONTANA PRIDE (2) did a good job to finish in the minor placings two runs back then things went sour last time when he broke and finished a long way back in eighth over 1710m at Ballarat. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Won't find this any harder and he can bounce back.",
